/* =====================================================================
   CLOTHING — every piece of clothing, Cyberpunk 2077 2.31 + Phantom Liberty
   Source: each item's Cyberpunk Wiki page (Infobox Clothing + Acquisition),
   read 2026-09-28. 1531 pages.
   id       the game's item id (wiki "baseid"); never change it
   slot     head · face · outer · inner · legs · feet · special (full-body outfit)
   variants ids like Jacket_22_basic_01 / _old_03 / _rich_02 share one model
            (Jacket_22) in different colours and finishes; the app groups them
   style    the wiki's fashion style · mfr = manufacturer · iconic = iconic item
   intr     intrinsic mod code, text in clothingIntrinsics below
   get      the infobox source (vendors: see clothingVendors) · how = the Acquisition
            text when it says more than "buy it from X" (exact spots, conditions)
   from     mission ids that give it · miss = missable (from the mission data)
   dep      depends on a choice · temp = only worn during a mission, not kept
   limited  Twitch drop / GOG reward etc. (listed, not counted)
   pl       Phantom Liberty page
   f / m    feminine / masculine body picture: path under the wiki's image store
   ===================================================================== */
